    "reason": "Organiser event page https://nofluffjuststuff.com/seattle (JSON-LD startDate 2026-11-12, endDate 2026-11-13; text 'November 12 - 13, 2026 - Seattle, WA') gives the venue as 'Aloft Redmond 15220 NE Shen Street Redmond, Washington, 98052'. Dates are right; the event physically happens in Redmond, 'Seattle' is only the series' market name. URL was the NFJS homepage listing every tour stop.",
